 "description": "<div><p>This dataset includes all of the voting places available to voters for the 2022 general election. The City of Vancouver uses a Vote-Anywhere model.​​ Since 2014, voters can vote at any voting place within the City.​​<br></p><p>​The City operates an at-large ​​voting system.​​<br></p><p>​​​​Advance voting days: Octobe​​r 1, 5, 8, 11, 13​​​</p><p>​​Election day: October 15​​</p><p>​​​​​​​Voting hours for all locations are 8am to 8pm.<br></p><p>\n<strong>Note:</strong></p><p>​UBC ​and UEL residents are only eligible to vote for School trustees.</p></div> <h3>Data currency</h3><div><p>​​These are the voting places used for the ​City's 2022 municipal general election during advance voting and on general voting day.​​<br></p></div> <h3>Websites for further information</h3><div><ul><li>\n<a href=\"https://vancouver.ca/your-government/civic-elections.aspx\">Municipal elections​</a>​<br></li></ul></div>",
